k a bit. I'm not always… this shape.","*growls* …Was that me? That was me."]},draconid:{any:["You summoned a DRAGON? Bold. Stupid, but bold.","Careful. I sneeze fire.","Scales are on backwards. Nope, they're fine.","Where's my hoard? I had a hoard. A small one. Okay, it was a pile of spoons."]},revenant:{any:["I was dead. I was enjoying it.","Again? You can't keep pulling me back like this.","Don't mind the smell. It's not your fault. It's mine.","Cold here. Or is that me?"]},construct:{any:["SYSTEM… REBOOT. Hello. Where am I.","Unit online. Purpose: unknown. Please input purpose.","My gears are full of sky. That is not a sentence I expected.","Error. Error. …Joke. I'm fine."]},vampire:{any:["Ugh, sunlight? No? Good. Carry on.","You yanked me out mid-dinner. Rude.","Don't worry, I only bite people I don't like. …So far that's everyone.","Lovely neck. - I mean. Hello."]},fae:{any:["Ooh, a rip in the world! Can we make another?","Did you just steal me? That's MY trick.","Tiny wings, big attitude. Hi!","If you say thank you to me, we're bound forever. Don't."]}},CL={any:["Nya?! Where - what - NYA!","Mrrow. …Don't laugh.","Meow. I mean. HELLO. I'm very serious.","*hisses* …Sorry. Reflex. Nya.","Is there fish here? Say yes. Nya."],f:["Nyaa~ who summoned me? You? Hmph. Fine.","My ears are twitching. That means I don't like you. Yet. Nya."],m:["Nya. Don't make it weird.","Mrrp. Which one of you pulled my tail?"]},MM={Farmer:{any:["My cows! Who's feeding my cows?","I was mid-harvest. The turnips won't pick themselves."]},Cook:{any:["I left the pot on. The whole kitchen's gonna burn.","You hungry? I'm hungry. Where's the kitchen."]},Merchant:{any:["Whatever this is, I want a cut.","Who's buying? Somebody's always buying."]},Miner:{any:["Up?! I've never been UP!","Too much sky. Give me a tunnel."]},Servant:{any:["Oh. A new master. Wonderful. Again.","I'll fetch… whatever it is you need fetched. Probably."]},Beggar:{any:["Spare a coin? …You're a god. Spare a bigger one.","Free food here? I'm staying."]},Fisher:{any:["Lost my best rod in that hole.","No water? What am I supposed to do here?"]},Peddler:{any:["My cart! I had a whole cart!","Pots, pans, a god? Don't have one of those. Yet."]},Laborer:{any:["I was carrying bricks. Now I'm carrying nothing. Weird.","If this is work, who's paying?"]},Porter:{any:["I dropped the luggage. Somebody's gonna kill me.","Heavy lifting? Sure. Just point."]},Maid:{f:["I was dusting! Who drags a maid out mid-dusting?!","This place is filthy. Where's a broom."],any:["I had a shift. Somebody's covering it, right?"]},Woodcutter:{any:["Somebody hand me an axe. I think better with an axe.","Huh. No trees up here?"]},Stablehand:{any:["Smells like horses. Oh wait, that's me.","Who's minding the horses?!"]},Militia:{any:["Militia, reporting! …To who? Where?","Ten days of training. I'm ready. Ish."]},Apprentice:{any:["My master's gonna KILL me.","I didn't finish the lesson. Is that important?"]},Squire:{any:["Sir? SIR? Where's my knight?","Do I polish things here? I'm good at polishing."]},Scout:{any:["I counted twelve exits on the way down. Kidding. There were none.","Recon says: we're very high up."]},Acolyte:{any:["Is this a sign from the gods? Are YOU the sign?","I prayed for change. Not this much change."]},Footman:{any:["Shield up. Shield - where's my shield.","Point me at the line and I'll hold it."]},Trapper:{any:["Didn't set a trap for THIS.","Something's hunting something here. I can feel it."]},Brawler:{any:["Who wants a punch? Anybody? You?","Finally. Something worth fighting."]},Herbalist:{any:["My poor herbs. Wilted, all of them.","You need a tea. You look stressed. I'm stressed."]},Slinger:{any:["Got a pocket full of rocks and no idea where I am.","Give me a target. Any target."]},Initiate:{any:["Is this the test? Am I passing?","The elders never mentioned THIS."]},Guardsman:{any:["Halt! …Halt who? Where am I?","My post! Somebody's gonna rob the gate!"]},Warrior:{any:["Ha! A fight's coming, I can smell it.","Whoever brought me - point. I'll swing."]},Rogue:{any:["Didn't steal anything. Swear. Okay, one thing.","Nice place. Lots of pockets."]},Archer:{any:["Get me a bow and stand back.","Quiet. I'm counting the wind."]},Mage:{any:["Fascinating. Terrible, but fascinating.","Somebody botched that spell. Badly. Was it you?"]},Cleric:{any:["The light brought me here? …Fine. I'll heal who I have to.","Bless you. You look like you need it."]},Lancer:{any:["Where's my horse? I'm useless without the horse.","Long spear, short temper. Hi."]},Ranger:{any:["Wild country up here. I like it.","Tracks everywhere. Nobody's, everybody's."]},Monk:{any:["Breathe in. Breathe out. Still in the sky. Okay.","Calm. Calm. …Where are we?"]},Duelist:{any:["Who's the best fighter here? Let's settle it.","One on one. Anytime. Anyone."]},Pikeman:{any:["Give me a long stick and a reason.","Formation? Is there a formation?"]},Hunter:{any:["Big game here. I can tell.","Smells like a hunt."]},Bard:{any:["Oh, there's a SONG in this!","Fell out of the sky. Great opening line."]},Knight:{any:["By my oath - what manner of sorcery is this?","A knight answers the call. Even a rude one."]},Berserker:{any:["RRRAAAH - oh. Nobody to hit yet. Hmph.","Let me at 'em. Whoever 'em is."]},Assassin:{any:["You saw me arrive. That's a first.","Who's the target? There's always a target."]}},Mx=(t,e,s)=>{if(!t)return null;const n=[...t.any??[],...t[e]??[]];return n.length?n[Math.floor(s*n.length)%n.length]:null};function _L(t,e){const s=String(t.gender??"").toLowerCase().startsWith("f")?"f":"m",n=String(t.race??"human"),o=e();return n==="beastkin"&&(Math.abs(t.id*2654435761)>>>0)%3===0&&o<.75?Mx(CL,s,e()):n!=="human"&&bM[n]&&o<.5?Mx(bM[n],s,e()):t.class&&MM[t.class]&&o<.85?Mx(MM[t.class],s,e()):null}const IL={confused:{lost:{any:["I was... I was just walking home. And then - here?","Wait. Where's my house? It was right - it was RIGHT there.","I was at the market a second ago. Wasn't I? Wasn't I just - ","Everything went white, and now... where is this?","This isn't my town. This isn't any town I know.","Am I dreaming? I have to be dreaming.","One breath I was in my bed. Now... this?","Where did the sky go? Why is it all wrong?","I don't understand. Put me back. Please, just put me back.","My feet were on my own road. How are they here?","Please tell me this isn't real. Please.","I just want to go home. How do I go home?","Something pulled me and I couldn't stop it. What was that?","I was doing my chores, and then the world just - tipped."],male:["I was out in the fields, same as every morning... and then?","I left my kids at the supper table a moment ago. Where are they?"],female:["I was with my husband... and now I'm here? How?","I was hanging the wash out back. Then everything tipped over."]},adapting:{any:["Who did this? Who dragged me here?!","Send me back. Right now. I mean it.","You think you can just - just TAKE a person?!","I don't care what you are. This is a kidnapping.","I didn't agree to any of this. Undo it!","You'd better start explaining. Fast.","I had a LIFE. What gives you the right?","Let me go. Let me GO.","Someone's going to answer for this. Is it you?","You pulled me out of my own world. Are you mad?","I'm not scared. I'm furious. There's a difference.","It was you, wasn't it? YOU did this."],male:["Put me back where you found me. Now."],female:["You tore me from everything I love. I could hate you forever for that."]},knowing:{any:["...Where am I? And why are you looking at me like you own me?","I don't know this place. But I know that look. What do you want?","Something's off here - and you're standing right in the middle of it.","This is too clean to be an accident. Someone planned it. You?","I'm calm. I'm just deciding whether to trust a word you say.","New sky, new ground, and you watching me. Start talking.","I've felt pulled before. Never like this. What did you do?","You want something from me. So out with it.","Whatever that was, it worked. Now